## 11. Open questions to ask before generating a brand-new config

- Regulation, asset class, control one-line description?
- Source system(s), file patterns/locations, and a real sample file (not just headers)?
- Target regulator report format — sample file or field spec available?
- Which existing reference/lookup files apply as-is vs need to be new?
- Asset-class-specific eligibility rules (reportable product list, edge cases)?
- Known break scenarios specific to this asset class/source system?
